diff --git a/docs/Reference/Server.md b/docs/Reference/Server.md
index 8832ddfc..0ea3b2ee 100644
--- a/docs/Reference/Server.md
+++ b/docs/Reference/Server.md
@@ -569,11 +569,26 @@ const fastify = require('fastify')({
       [require('ajv-keywords'), 'instanceof']
       // Usage: [plugin, pluginOptions] - Plugin with options
       // Usage: plugin - Plugin without options
-    ]
+    ],
+    onCreate: (ajv) => {
+      // Modify the ajv instance as you need
+      ajv.addFormat('myFormat', (data) => typeof data === 'string')
+    }
   }
 })
 ```
 
+The `ajv` option is passed as-is to
+[`@fastify/ajv-compiler`](https://github.com/fastify/ajv-compiler), refer to its
+documentation for the full list of supported options:
+
+- `customOptions`: the [Ajv options](https://ajv.js.org/options.html) used to
+  create the Ajv instance.
+- `plugins`: a list of Ajv plugins, or `[plugin, pluginOptions]` tuples. Each
+  plugin must follow the Ajv plugin convention and return the Ajv instance.
+- `onCreate`: a function called with the Ajv instance right after it is
+  created, useful to further customize it (e.g. adding formats or keywords).
+
 ### `serializerOpts`
 <a id="serializer-opts"></a>
 
